          "explanation": "The doctor used supportive, non-blaming language tailored to fear and fatigue, reinforcing correct actions.",
          "quote": "不自己打针、不喝中药、主动反馈感受"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The patient was visibly anxious and fatigued; the doctor repeatedly used stabilizing, non-shaming language and converted concerns into simple behavioral rules that the patient could follow and repeat.",
      "ho_id": "HO1",
