          "explanation": "The doctor supplied an exact phrase for the patient to use at triage, improving execution despite stress and family pressure.",
          "quote": "我是高危孕妇，胎儿偏小、脐带血流不好"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_02422",
          "explanation": "The doctor addressed caregiver logistics and hospital readiness while avoiding unnecessary crowding.",
          "quote": "电话保持畅通、别跑远"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor addressed real-world barriers including where to go, what to say, what to bring, how to handle family presence, and how to clarify inpatient next steps.",
